Package: fastsaegpu
Type: Package
Title: GPU-Accelerated Hierarchical Bayesian Small Area Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ridson", "Al Farizal P", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "alfrzlp@gmail.com")
Description: Hierarchical Bayesian area-level Small Area Estimation (SAE)
    with spatio-temporal dynamics powered by 'NumPyro' <https://num.pyro.ai/>
    and 'JAX' <https://jax.readthedocs.io/> on NVIDIA (CUDA) GPUs or the CPU
    (the Apple Silicon 'Metal' backend cannot yet run the NUTS sampler, so it
    falls back to the CPU). Provides spatial,
    temporal, and spatio-temporal interactions for continuous, count, and
    bounded survey outcomes using Markov Chain Monte Carlo (MCMC) sampling.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/ridsonap/fastsae-gpu
BugReports: https://github.com/ridsonap/fastsae-gpu/issues
